    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description>HomeBank is a free software (as in "free speech" and also as in "free beer") that will assist you to manage your personal accounting.
It is designed to easy to use and be able to analyse your personal finance and budget in detail using powerful filtering tools and beautiful charts.
If you are looking for a completely free and easy application to manage your personal accounting, budget, finance then HomeBank should be the software of choice.

**Please Note**: This is an automatically updated package. If you find it is out of date by more than a day or two, please contact the maintainer(s) and let them know the package is no longer updating correctly.</description>
    <summary>Free personal finance, Free money management, Free personal accounting.</summary>
    <releaseNotes>
Made 5.10.3 release
* new: factorised some pickers
* new: ledger quicksearch support multi terms search
* new: ledger quicksearch support " for exact search (terms with space)
* new: completed translation of 60 languages using Claude AI
* new: full available languages rise from 20 to 80
* change: code naming sanitize &gt; *item to *abvtype
* change: code naming sanitize &gt; *entry to *abvtype
* change: code naming sanitize &gt; archive to template
* change: code naming sanitize &gt; operation to transaction
* change: speed optimisation with file of 14M txn, 60k acc/pay/cat/tag/tpl/sch/asg
* change: account manager could be slow due to template ComboBoxText in Behavior tab
* change: template manager merge dialog could be slow due to template ComboBoxText
* change: removed the date exclusion for filter
* bugfix: duplicate a template was not changing its key
* bugfix: #[2162840](https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2162840) exclude date filter in statistics report does not work
* bugfix: #[2162690](https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2162690) filter transaction type do not fully separate normal/transfer
* bugfix: #[2162642](https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2162642) balance report list shows incomes in red
* bugfix: #[2161855](https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2161855) "This Year" preset date filter fail when fiscal year is set to Aug 1st
* bugfix: #[2161830](https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2161830) Bugdet option "Include transfer" is not persisted
* bugfix: #[2161453](https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2161453) changes not always propagate when multiple ledger are opened
* bugfix: #[2161266](https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2161266) "Result" and "Detail" to clipboard and CSV menu items are missing verbs and "…"
* bugfix: #[2161226](https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2161226) Remove G_GNUC_CONST from *get_type declarations
* bugfix: #[2160080](https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2160080) inherit always enabled and crash if no transaction selected
* bugfix: #[2159561](https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2159561) slowness of dialog to appear when edit a transaction
* bugfix: #[2159560](https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2159560) ledger quicksearch match unwanted transaction
* bugfix: #[2159010](https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2159010) summary page shows account in red

**Full changelog:** [https://www.gethomebank.org/ChangeLog](https://www.gethomebank.org/ChangeLog)</releaseNotes>
